WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
Legal Basis.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:11.300
Criminal Code section 504 allows any Canadian citizen to lay criminal charges by appearing before a Justice of the Peace with sworn information.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:18.387
This private prosecution pathway exists precisely for cases where the state refuses to investigate its own.

00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:22.100
28 counts have been filed against Covey and Bae.
